<p>I started using <a class="link-external" rel="external" href="https://typst.app">Typst</a> about a month ago to write my dissertation proposal. I had seen Typst before and decided to keep an eye on it as it matured. While it still is very much in development, it is mature enough that I was able to rewrite my dissertation proposal from an org-mode → LaTeX pipeline to pure Typst in about an hour with <em>no</em> major hiccups. In fact, most things got <em>simpler</em> as a consequence of using Typst.</p>